  "files": {
    "index.html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no,viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>HTML to VAiOS App Builder</title>\n<style>\n  :root{--bg:#020604;--panel:#07180d;--panel2:#0c2415;--line:#27533a;--line2:#6fb47f;--text:#eaffef;--muted:#a8cdb1;--accent:#22c55e;--bad:#ef4444;--warn:#eab308;--good:#22c55e;--shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.48)}\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%}\n  html,body{margin:0;min-height:100%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 14% 0%,rgba(34,197,94,.18),transparent 32%),linear-gradient(135deg,#020604,#062012 70%,#020604);color:var(--text);font-family:Tahoma,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden}\n  body{padding:12px;user-select:none}\n  button,input,textarea,select{font:inherit;color:var(--text)}\n  button{border:2px solid #173624;border-top-color:#8ed3a0;border-left-color:#8ed3a0;border-right-color:#020604;border-bottom-color:#020604;background:#14532d;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;min-height:38px}\n  button:active{transform:translateY(1px);border-color:#020604 #8ed3a0 #8ed3a0 #020604}\n  button.primary{background:#166534}button.good{background:#15803d}button.warn{background:#854d0e}button.bad{background:#7f1d1d}button.ghost{background:#07180d}\n  input,textarea,select{width:100%;background:#041109;border:2px inset #315d43;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;outline:none;user-select:text}\n  textarea{min-height:160px;resize:vertical;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;line-height:1.35;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px}\n  label{display:block;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#b8e6c5;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 5px}\n  h1,h2,h3{margin:0 0 8px}.wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}.logo{width:52px;height:52px;border:2px outset #6fb47f;background:#052e16;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:30px}.title{flex:1;min-width:240px}.title h1{font-size:22px}.title p{margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.pill{border:1px solid #386b4a;background:#041109;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 8px;color:#c9f7d3;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:390px minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px}.card{background:rgba(7,24,13,.94);border:2px inset #315d43;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-width:0}.row{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center}.wraprow{flex-wrap:wrap}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.status{white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;background:#041109;border:2px inset #315d43;border-radius:8px;min-height:48px;padding:8px;color:#dfffea;font-size:12px;user-select:text}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.tiny{font-size:11px}.drop{border:2px dashed #4c8d62;border-radius:14px;padding:14px;text-align:center;background:rgba(4,17,9,.7);min-height:112px;display:grid;place-items:center}.drop.drag{background:rgba(34,197,94,.16);border-color:#bbf7d0}.fileline{font-size:12px;color:#bbf7d0;margin-top:6px;word-break:break-all}.previewShell{height:calc(100vh - 142px);min-height:520px;display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr;gap:8px}.previewBar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.previewBar strong{flex:1;min-width:150px}.framebox{border:2px inset #315d43;border-radius:10px;background:#000;overflow:hidden;min-height:0}.framebox iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;background:#fff}.checkrow{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;margin:7px 0}.checkrow input{width:auto}.meter{height:10px;background:#031008;border:1px solid #315d43;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}.meter span{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#22c55e,#eab308);width:0}.actions button{flex:1;min-width:130px}.mono{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace}.ok{color:#86efac}.warntext{color:#fde68a}.badtext{color:#fecaca}\n  @media(max-width:880px){body{padding:8px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.previewShell{height:640px}.two,.three{grid-template-columns:1fr}.actions button{min-width:100%}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">📦</div>\n    <div class=\"title\"><h1>HTML → VAiOS App Builder</h1><p>Import any self-contained HTML file and export a clean <b>.vaios</b> app package. Big files are kept out of <code>item.html</code> so fresh desktops can import through IndexedDB.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"pill\" id=\"filePill\">No HTML loaded</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>1. Load HTML</h2>\n      <div id=\"drop\" class=\"drop\">\n        <div>\n          <button id=\"pick\" class=\"primary\">Choose .html file</button>\n          <div class=\"fileline\" id=\"fileLine\">or drag/drop one here</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <input id=\"file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".html,.htm,text/html\" style=\"display:none\">\n\n      <h2 style=\"margin-top:12px\">2. App metadata</h2>\n      <div class=\"two\">\n        <div><label>App name</label><input id=\"name\" value=\"Imported HTML App\"></div>\n        <div><label>Start/menu name</label><input id=\"entry\" value=\"Imported HTML App\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"two\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n        <div><label>Category 1</label><input id=\"cat1\" value=\"Apps\"></div>\n        <div><label>Category 2</label><input id=\"cat2\" value=\"Imported\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"three\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n        <div><label>Type</label><select id=\"type\"><option value=\"app\">app</option><option value=\"widget\">widget</option></select></div>\n        <div><label>Width</label><input id=\"w\" type=\"number\" min=\"180\" max=\"2400\" value=\"1100\"></div>\n        <div><label>Height</label><input id=\"h\" type=\"number\" min=\"120\" max=\"1800\" value=\"760\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"two\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">\n        <div><label>Version</label><input id=\"ver\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"999\" value=\"1\"></div>\n        <div><label>Desktop icon</label><select id=\"desktop\"><option value=\"true\">yes</option><option value=\"false\">no</option></select></div>\n      </div>\n      <label style=\"margin-top:8px\">Icon SVG or emoji</label>\n      <textarea id=\"icon\" style=\"min-height:84px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"9\" width=\"50\" height=\"46\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#052e16\" stroke=\"#86efac\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M18 24h28M18 34h22M18 44h16\" stroke=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M45 13l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></textarea>\n      <label style=\"margin-top:8px\">Notes</label>\n      <textarea id=\"notes\" style=\"min-height:76px\">Generated by HTML to VAiOS App Builder. Source HTML is stored in files/index.html, not duplicated inside item.html.</textarea>\n\n      <div class=\"checkrow\"><input id=\"injectFs\" type=\"checkbox\"><label for=\"injectFs\" style=\"margin:0;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:12px\">Inject tiny in-app fullscreen button into HTML</label></div>\n      <div class=\"checkrow\"><input id=\"addReadme\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><label for=\"addReadme\" style=\"margin:0;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:12px\">Include readme/spec note inside package</label></div>\n\n      <div class=\"row wraprow actions\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n        <button id=\"download\" class=\"good\">Download .vaios</button>\n        <button id=\"copy\" class=\"ghost\">Copy package JSON</button>\n        <button id=\"downloadHtml\" class=\"ghost\">Download current HTML</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"status\" id=\"status\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Ready. Load an HTML file.</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card previewShell\">\n      <div class=\"previewBar\">\n        <strong>Preview</strong>\n        <button id=\"reload\" class=\"ghost\">Reload preview</button>\n        <button id=\"fs\" class=\"primary\">Fullscreen preview</button>\n        <button id=\"clear\" class=\"bad\">Clear</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"framebox\"><iframe id=\"preview\" title=\"HTML preview\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-modals allow-popups allow-downloads allow-same-origin allow-pointer-lock\" allow=\"fullscreen; pointer-lock; gamepad; autoplay; clipboard-read; clipboard-write\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  'use strict';\n  var importedHtml='';\n  var importedFileName='';\n  var lastPackage='';\n  var $=function(id){return document.getElementById(id)};\n  var els={file:$('file'),pick:$('pick'),drop:$('drop'),fileLine:$('fileLine'),filePill:$('filePill'),name:$('name'),entry:$('entry'),cat1:$('cat1'),cat2:$('cat2'),type:$('type'),w:$('w'),h:$('h'),ver:$('ver'),desktop:$('desktop'),icon:$('icon'),notes:$('notes'),injectFs:$('injectFs'),addReadme:$('addReadme'),download:$('download'),copy:$('copy'),downloadHtml:$('downloadHtml'),status:$('status'),preview:$('preview'),reload:$('reload'),fs:$('fs'),clear:$('clear')};\n  function nowIso(){return new Date().toISOString()}\n  function slug(s){return String(s||'app').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,'-').replace(/^-+|-+$/g,'').slice(0,52)||'app'}\n  function clean(s,fallback){s=String(s||'').replace(/\\s+/g,' ').trim();return (s||fallback||'Untitled').slice(0,90)}\n  function byteLen(s){try{return new Blob([String(s||'')]).size}catch(e){return String(s||'').length}}\n  function humanBytes(n){n=Number(n)||0;var u=['B','KB','MB','GB'];var i=0;while(n>=1024&&i<u.length-1){n/=1024;i++}return (i?n.toFixed(n>=10?1:2):Math.round(n))+ ' '+u[i]}\n  function uid(p){return (p||'app')+'_'+Date.now().toString(36)+'_'+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,8)}\n  function setStatus(s){els.status.textContent=s}\n  function safeNameFromFile(name){name=String(name||'Imported HTML App').replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'').replace(/[_-]+/g,' ').replace(/\\s+/g,' ').trim();return clean(name,'Imported HTML App')}\n  function downloadBlob(content,name,type){var blob=new Blob([content],{type:type||'application/octet-stream'});var a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download=name;document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();setTimeout(function(){URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href);a.remove()},1000)}\n  function injectFullscreenButton(html){\n    var style='\\n<style id=\"vaios-inline-fullscreen-style\">#vaiosInlineFullscreen{position:fixed;right:12px;top:12px;z-index:2147483647;background:rgba(3,16,8,.88);color:#eaffef;border:2px solid #86efac;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;font:900 13px system-ui,Tahoma,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.45);cursor:pointer}</style>\\n';\n    var scriptOpen='<scr'+'ipt id=\"vaios-inline-fullscreen-script\">';\n    var scriptClose='</scr'+'ipt>';\n    var script='(function(){if(document.getElementById(\"vaiosInlineFullscreen\"))return;var b=document.createElement(\"button\");b.id=\"vaiosInlineFullscreen\";b.type=\"button\";b.textContent=\"⛶ Fullscreen\";b.addEventListener(\"click\",function(){var el=document.documentElement;if(el.requestFullscreen)el.requestFullscreen();else if(el.webkitRequestFullscreen)el.webkitRequestFullscreen();});document.addEventListener(\"keydown\",function(e){if(e.key===\"F11\"||((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()===\"f\")){try{b.click()}catch(_){}}});document.body.appendChild(b);})();';\n    var code=style+scriptOpen+script+scriptClose+'\\n';\n    html=String(html||'');\n    if(/<\\/body>/i.test(html))return html.replace(/<\\/body>/i,code+'</body>');\n    return html+code;\n  }\n\n  function currentHtml(){var h=importedHtml||'<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Imported HTML App</title></head><body><h1>Imported HTML App</h1><p>No source loaded yet.</p></body></html>';return els.injectFs.checked?injectFullscreenButton(h):h}\n  function updatePreview(){var h=currentHtml();els.preview.setAttribute('allow','fullscreen; pointer-lock; gamepad; autoplay; clipboard-read; clipboard-write');els.preview.allowFullscreen=true;els.preview.srcdoc=h;setStatus(statusText('Preview refreshed.'))}\n  function statusText(prefix){var h=currentHtml();var big=byteLen(h)>1024*1024?\"\\nLarge app rule: OK. HTML will be stored only in files/index.html, not duplicated into item.html.\":\"\";return (prefix?prefix+'\\n':'')+'File: '+(importedFileName||'none')+'\\nHTML size: '+humanBytes(byteLen(h))+'\\nOutput name: '+clean(els.name.value,'Imported HTML App')+'.vaios'+big}\n  function buildPackage(){\n    var h=currentHtml();\n    if(!h.trim())throw new Error('No HTML loaded.');\n    var type=els.type.value==='widget'?'widget':'app';\n    var name=clean(els.name.value,'Imported HTML App');\n    var entry=clean(els.entry.value,name);\n    var id=slug(name)+'_'+Date.now().toString(36);\n    var folder=(type==='widget'?'/Widgets/':'/Apps/')+slug(name);\n    var created=nowIso();\n    var item={\n      id:id,type:type,name:name,category1:clean(els.cat1.value,type==='widget'?'Widgets':'Apps'),category2:clean(els.cat2.value,'Imported'),entryName:entry,\n      icon:String(els.icon.value||'📄'),desktopIcon:els.desktop.value==='true',preferredWidth:Math.max(180,Math.min(2400,Number(els.w.value)||1100)),preferredHeight:Math.max(120,Math.min(1800,Number(els.h.value)||760)),\n      html:'',notes:String(els.notes.value||''),parentId:'',editPrompt:'',version:Math.max(1,Math.min(999,Number(els.ver.value)||1)),baseName:name,createdAt:created,updatedAt:created,htmlSize:byteLen(h),externalHtmlKey:''\n    };\n    var manifest=Object.assign({},item,{html:undefined,folder:folder,sourcePath:folder+'/index.html',manifestPath:folder+'/manifest.json',itemJsonPath:folder+'/item.json'});\n    var itemJson=Object.assign({},item,{folder:folder,sourcePath:folder+'/index.html',manifestPath:folder+'/manifest.json',itemJsonPath:folder+'/item.json'});\n    var files={\n      'index.html':h,\n      'manifest.json':JSON.stringify(manifest,null,2),\n      'item.json':JSON.stringify(itemJson,null,2)\n    };\n    if(els.addReadme.checked){files['readme.txt']='This VAiOS package was created by HTML to VAiOS App Builder. The real app source is files/index.html. The item.html field is intentionally blank so large self-contained HTML files do not duplicate data and trigger storage quota errors. Import with a VAiOS desktop that supports files/index.html and IndexedDB large-source storage. Generated: '+created+'\\n';}\n    return {kind:'vaios-app-package',extension:'vaios',version:1,createdAt:created,desktop:'Virtual Desktop Builder',item:item,folder:folder,files:files};\n  }\n  var __vdSeq=0,__vdPending={};\n  window.addEventListener('message',function(ev){var m=ev.data||{};if(!m.__vdesktop_reply||!m.requestId||!__vdPending[m.requestId])return;var p=__vdPending[m.requestId];delete __vdPending[m.requestId];if(m.ok)p.resolve(m.result);else p.reject(new Error(m.error||'Desktop bridge request failed.'));});\n  function callDesktop(action,payload,timeout){return new Promise(function(resolve,reject){if(!(window.parent&&window.parent!==window&&typeof window.parent.postMessage==='function')){reject(new Error('Not running inside the VAiOS desktop iframe.'));return}var rid='htmlvaios_'+(++__vdSeq)+'_'+Date.now();var timer=setTimeout(function(){if(__vdPending[rid]){delete __vdPending[rid];reject(new Error('Desktop bridge timed out: '+action));}},timeout||300000);__vdPending[rid]={resolve:function(v){clearTimeout(timer);resolve(v)},reject:function(e){clearTimeout(timer);reject(e)}};var msg=Object.assign({__vdesktop:true,action:action,requestId:rid},payload||{});window.parent.postMessage(msg,'*');});}\n  function desktopAIReady(){return !!((window.VDesktop&&typeof window.VDesktop.askAI==='function')||(window.parent&&window.parent!==window&&typeof window.parent.postMessage==='function'))}\n  function desktopInstallReady(){return !!((window.VDesktop&&typeof window.VDesktop.installVaiosText==='function')||(window.parent&&window.parent!==window&&typeof window.parent.postMessage==='function'))}\n  function desktopAskAI(systemPrompt,userPrompt,kind){if(window.VDesktop&&typeof window.VDesktop.askAI==='function')return window.VDesktop.askAI(systemPrompt,userPrompt,kind);return callDesktop('askAI',{systemPrompt:String(systemPrompt||''),userPrompt:String(userPrompt||''),kind:kind||'html'},300000)}\n  function desktopInstallVaiosText(raw,opts){opts=opts||{};if(window.VDesktop&&typeof window.VDesktop.installVaiosText==='function')return window.VDesktop.installVaiosText(raw,opts);return callDesktop('installVaiosText',{raw:String(raw||''),ask:opts.ask!==false,openAfter:!!opts.openAfter},120000)}\n  function stripFence(s){return String(s||'').replace(/^```[a-zA-Z0-9_-]*\\s*/,'').replace(/```$/,'').trim()}\n  function looksSvg(s){s=String(s||'').trim();return /^<svg[\\s>]/i.test(s)&&/<\\/svg>\\s*$/i.test(s)&&!/script/i.test(s)}\n  function parseJsonLoose(s){s=stripFence(s);try{return JSON.parse(s)}catch(e){}var m=s.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);if(m){try{return JSON.parse(m[0])}catch(e){}}return null}\n  function escXml(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\\\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c]||c})}\n  function fallbackSvg(name,type){var label=clean(name||'HTML','HTML').slice(0,3).toUpperCase().replace(/[^A-Z0-9]/g,'')||'HTML';var badge=(type==='widget'?'W':'A');return '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"5\" width=\"50\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#031008\" stroke=\"#86efac\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M18 18h28M18 29h22M18 40h28\" stroke=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"39\" y=\"39\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#166534\" stroke=\"#22c55e\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"50\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#eafff0\">'+badge+'</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"15\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#eafff0\">'+escXml(label)+'</text></svg>'}\n  function updatePackageRecords(pkg,item){var folder=(item.type==='widget'?'/Widgets/':'/Apps/')+slug(item.name);pkg.folder=folder;pkg.item=item;var manifest=Object.assign({},item,{html:undefined,folder:folder,sourcePath:folder+'/index.html',manifestPath:folder+'/manifest.json',itemJsonPath:folder+'/item.json'});var itemJson=Object.assign({},item,{folder:folder,sourcePath:folder+'/index.html',manifestPath:folder+'/manifest.json',itemJsonPath:folder+'/item.json'});pkg.files=pkg.files||{};pkg.files['manifest.json']=JSON.stringify(manifest,null,2);pkg.files['item.json']=JSON.stringify(itemJson,null,2);return pkg}\n  async function enhancePkgWithLLM(pkg){\n    var item=pkg.item||{};var html=String((pkg.files&&pkg.files['index.html'])||'').slice(0,9000);var notes=[];var icon=item.icon;\n    var context='Current name: '+String(item.name||'')+'\\nType: '+String(item.type||'app')+'\\nCategory: '+String(item.category1||'')+' / '+String(item.category2||'')+'\\nFile name: '+String(importedFileName||'')+'\\nHTML start:\\n'+html.slice(0,4500);\n    if(!desktopAIReady()){notes.push('Desktop LLM bridge unavailable. Used generated fallback SVG/metadata.');icon=fallbackSvg(item.name,item.type)}else{\n      try{setStatus('LLM pass 1/2: generating SVG icon...');var svg=await desktopAskAI('Return ONLY one inline SVG element. No markdown. No JSON. Use <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">. No scripts. No external images. Make it clear as a small VAiOS desktop icon.','Create an SVG icon for this VAiOS '+String(item.type||'app')+' made from imported HTML. The icon should represent what the HTML appears to do, not the builder tool.\\n\\n'+context,'svg');svg=stripFence(svg).replace(/^.*?(<svg[\\s\\S]*<\\/svg>).*$/i,'$1').trim();if(looksSvg(svg))icon=svg;else throw new Error('LLM did not return a valid SVG.')}catch(e){notes.push('SVG LLM skipped: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)));icon=fallbackSvg(item.name,item.type)}}\n    var meta=null;\n    if(desktopAIReady()){\n      try{setStatus('LLM pass 2/2: generating metadata...');var raw=await desktopAskAI('Return ONLY strict JSON. Shape: {\"type\":\"app or widget\",\"name\":\"short display name\",\"category1\":\"generic top-level category\",\"category2\":\"generic second-level category\",\"entryName\":\"menu item name\",\"desktopIcon\":true,\"preferredWidth\":1100,\"preferredHeight\":760}. No markdown.','Create clean VAiOS metadata for this imported HTML. Keep names short, categories generic, and infer app vs widget only from the HTML purpose.\\n\\n'+context,'json');meta=parseJsonLoose(raw);if(!meta||typeof meta!=='object')throw new Error('LLM metadata was not JSON.')}catch(e){notes.push('Metadata LLM skipped: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)))}}\n    if(meta){\n      var chosenType=(meta.type==='widget'||meta.type==='app')?meta.type:item.type;item.type=chosenType;\n      item.name=clean(meta.name,item.name);item.entryName=clean(meta.entryName||meta.name,item.entryName||item.name);item.category1=clean(meta.category1,item.category1||'Apps');item.category2=clean(meta.category2,item.category2||'Imported');item.desktopIcon=meta.desktopIcon!==false;\n      item.preferredWidth=Math.max(180,Math.min(2400,Number(meta.preferredWidth)||item.preferredWidth||1100));item.preferredHeight=Math.max(120,Math.min(1800,Number(meta.preferredHeight)||item.preferredHeight||760));\n      item.baseName=item.name;\n    }\n    item.icon=icon;item.updatedAt=nowIso();item.notes=String(item.notes||'')+'\\nSVG/metadata pass ran during .vaios download.'+(notes.length?'\\n'+notes.join('\\n'):'');\n    if(notes.length)setStatus('LLM had an issue, but package is still valid.\\n'+notes.join('\\n'));else setStatus('LLM SVG/metadata complete. Packaging .vaios...');\n    return updatePackageRecords(pkg,item);\n  }\n  async function makeAndDownload(){try{var pkg=buildPackage();setStatus('Preparing VAiOS package: LLM SVG/metadata pass...');pkg=await enhancePkgWithLLM(pkg);lastPackage=JSON.stringify(pkg,null,2);downloadBlob(lastPackage,slug(pkg.item.name)+'-v'+pkg.item.version+'.vaios','application/vnd.vaios+json');setStatus(statusText('Downloaded VAiOS package. Name: '+pkg.item.name));if(desktopInstallReady()){try{setStatus('Download complete. Asking desktop if you want to install it...');var res=await desktopInstallVaiosText(lastPackage,{ask:true,openAfter:false});if(res&&res.installed)setStatus('Downloaded and installed: '+res.name);else setStatus('Downloaded. Install skipped.');}catch(e){setStatus('Downloaded, but install request failed: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)))}}}catch(e){setStatus('Build failed: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)))}}\n  async function copyPackage(){try{var pkg=buildPackage();setStatus('Preparing copy: LLM SVG/metadata pass...');pkg=await enhancePkgWithLLM(pkg);lastPackage=JSON.stringify(pkg,null,2);if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(lastPackage).then(function(){setStatus('Package JSON copied to clipboard.');},function(){setStatus('Clipboard blocked. Use Download .vaios instead.');});}else{setStatus('Clipboard API unavailable. Use Download .vaios.')}}catch(e){setStatus('Copy failed: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)))}}\n  function loadFile(f){if(!f)return;var r=new FileReader();r.onload=function(){importedHtml=String(r.result||'');importedFileName=f.name||'imported.html';var nm=safeNameFromFile(importedFileName);els.name.value=nm;els.entry.value=nm;els.fileLine.textContent=importedFileName+' · '+humanBytes(byteLen(importedHtml));els.filePill.textContent=humanBytes(byteLen(importedHtml));setStatus(statusText('Loaded HTML.'));updatePreview();};r.onerror=function(){setStatus('Could not read file.');};r.readAsText(f)}\n  els.pick.onclick=function(){els.file.click()};\n  els.file.onchange=function(e){loadFile(e.target.files&&e.target.files[0])};\n  ['dragenter','dragover'].forEach(function(ev){els.drop.addEventListener(ev,function(e){e.preventDefault();els.drop.classList.add('drag')})});\n  ['dragleave','drop'].forEach(function(ev){els.drop.addEventListener(ev,function(e){e.preventDefault();els.drop.classList.remove('drag')})});\n  els.drop.addEventListener('drop',function(e){var f=e.dataTransfer&&e.dataTransfer.files&&e.dataTransfer.files[0];loadFile(f)});\n  els.reload.onclick=updatePreview;\n  els.fs.onclick=function(){var target=els.preview;if(target.requestFullscreen)target.requestFullscreen();else if(target.webkitRequestFullscreen)target.webkitRequestFullscreen();};\n  els.clear.onclick=function(){importedHtml='';importedFileName='';els.preview.srcdoc='';els.fileLine.textContent='or drag/drop one here';els.filePill.textContent='No HTML loaded';setStatus('Cleared.');};\n  els.download.onclick=makeAndDownload;\n  els.copy.onclick=copyPackage;\n  els.downloadHtml.onclick=function(){downloadBlob(currentHtml(),slug(clean(els.name.value,'imported-app'))+'.html','text/html')};\n  [els.name,els.entry,els.cat1,els.cat2,els.type,els.w,els.h,els.ver,els.desktop,els.icon,els.notes,els.injectFs,els.addReadme].forEach(function(el){el.addEventListener('input',function(){setStatus(statusText('Settings updated.'))});el.addEventListener('change',function(){setStatus(statusText('Settings updated.'))})});\n  setStatus(statusText('Ready. Load an HTML file. Download .vaios runs SVG/metadata LLM pass first, with fallback if local fetch fails.'));\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "manifest.json": "{\n  \"id\": \"html_to_vaios_builder_v1\",\n  \"type\": \"app\",\n  \"name\": \"HTML to VAiOS\",\n  \"category1\": \"System\",\n  \"category2\": \"Create\",\n  \"entryName\": \"HTML to VAiOS\",\n  \"icon\": \"<svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><rect x=\\\"6\\\" y=\\\"8\\\" width=\\\"52\\\" height=\\\"48\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#052e16\\\" stroke=\\\"#86efac\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\"/><path d=\\\"M17 22h30M17 33h22M17 44h30\\\" stroke=\\\"#bbf7d0\\\" stroke-width=\\\"5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/><path d=\\\"M43 12l9 9-9 9\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#22c55e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/></svg>\",\n  \"desktopIcon\": true,\n  \"preferredWidth\": 1200,\n  \"preferredHeight\": 820,\n  \"notes\": \"Universal builder that converts any self-contained HTML file into a valid VAiOS app package. Source is stored in files/index.html only to avoid quota duplication.\",\n  \"parentId\": \"\",\n  \"editPrompt\": \"\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"baseName\": \"HTML to VAiOS Builder\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:23:04Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:28:32Z\",\n  \"htmlSize\": 25187\n}",
    "item.json": "{\n  \"id\": \"html_to_vaios_builder_v1\",\n  \"type\": \"app\",\n  \"name\": \"HTML to VAiOS\",\n  \"category1\": \"System\",\n  \"category2\": \"Create\",\n  \"entryName\": \"HTML to VAiOS\",\n  \"icon\": \"<svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><rect x=\\\"6\\\" y=\\\"8\\\" width=\\\"52\\\" height=\\\"48\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#052e16\\\" stroke=\\\"#86efac\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\"/><path d=\\\"M17 22h30M17 33h22M17 44h30\\\" stroke=\\\"#bbf7d0\\\" stroke-width=\\\"5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/><path d=\\\"M43 12l9 9-9 9\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#22c55e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/></svg>\",\n  \"desktopIcon\": true,\n  \"preferredWidth\": 1200,\n  \"preferredHeight\": 820,\n  \"html\": \"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no,viewport-fit=cover\\\">\\n<title>HTML to VAiOS App Builder</title>\\n<style>\\n  :root{--bg:#020604;--panel:#07180d;--panel2:#0c2415;--line:#27533a;--line2:#6fb47f;--text:#eaffef;--muted:#a8cdb1;--accent:#22c55e;--bad:#ef4444;--warn:#eab308;--good:#22c55e;--shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.48)}\\n  *{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%}\\n  html,body{margin:0;min-height:100%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 14% 0%,rgba(34,197,94,.18),transparent 32%),linear-gradient(135deg,#020604,#062012 70%,#020604);color:var(--text);font-family:Tahoma,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden}\\n  body{padding:12px;user-select:none}\\n  button,input,textarea,select{font:inherit;color:var(--text)}\\n  button{border:2px solid #173624;border-top-color:#8ed3a0;border-left-color:#8ed3a0;border-right-color:#020604;border-bottom-color:#020604;background:#14532d;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer;min-height:38px}\\n  button:active{transform:translateY(1px);border-color:#020604 #8ed3a0 #8ed3a0 #020604}\\n  button.primary{background:#166534}button.good{background:#15803d}button.warn{background:#854d0e}button.bad{background:#7f1d1d}button.ghost{background:#07180d}\\n  input,textarea,select{width:100%;background:#041109;border:2px inset #315d43;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;outline:none;user-select:text}\\n  textarea{min-height:160px;resize:vertical;white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;line-height:1.35;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px}\\n  label{display:block;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#b8e6c5;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 5px}\\n  h1,h2,h3{margin:0 0 8px}.wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}.top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:10px}.logo{width:52px;height:52px;border:2px outset #6fb47f;background:#052e16;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:30px}.title{flex:1;min-width:240px}.title h1{font-size:22px}.title p{margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}.pill{border:1px solid #386b4a;background:#041109;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 8px;color:#c9f7d3;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:390px minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px}.card{background:rgba(7,24,13,.94);border:2px inset #315d43;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-width:0}.row{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center}.wraprow{flex-wrap:wrap}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.status{white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;background:#041109;border:2px inset #315d43;border-radius:8px;min-height:48px;padding:8px;color:#dfffea;font-size:12px;user-select:text}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.tiny{font-size:11px}.drop{border:2px dashed #4c8d62;border-radius:14px;padding:14px;text-align:center;background:rgba(4,17,9,.7);min-height:112px;display:grid;place-items:center}.drop.drag{background:rgba(34,197,94,.16);border-color:#bbf7d0}.fileline{font-size:12px;color:#bbf7d0;margin-top:6px;word-break:break-all}.previewShell{height:calc(100vh - 142px);min-height:520px;display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr;gap:8px}.previewBar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.previewBar strong{flex:1;min-width:150px}.framebox{border:2px inset #315d43;border-radius:10px;background:#000;overflow:hidden;min-height:0}.framebox iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;background:#fff}.checkrow{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;margin:7px 0}.checkrow input{width:auto}.meter{height:10px;background:#031008;border:1px solid #315d43;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}.meter span{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#22c55e,#eab308);width:0}.actions button{flex:1;min-width:130px}.mono{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace}.ok{color:#86efac}.warntext{color:#fde68a}.badtext{color:#fecaca}\\n  @media(max-width:880px){body{padding:8px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.previewShell{height:640px}.two,.three{grid-template-columns:1fr}.actions button{min-width:100%}}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"top\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"logo\\\">\\ud83d\\udce6</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"title\\\"><h1>HTML \\u2192 VAiOS App Builder</h1><p>Import any self-contained HTML file and export a clean <b>.vaios</b> app package. Big files are kept out of <code>item.html</code> so fresh desktops can import through IndexedDB.</p></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pill\\\" id=\\\"filePill\\\">No HTML loaded</div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h2>1. Load HTML</h2>\\n      <div id=\\\"drop\\\" class=\\\"drop\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <button id=\\\"pick\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Choose .html file</button>\\n          <div class=\\\"fileline\\\" id=\\\"fileLine\\\">or drag/drop one here</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <input id=\\\"file\\\" type=\\\"file\\\" accept=\\\".html,.htm,text/html\\\" style=\\\"display:none\\\">\\n\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">2. App metadata</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"two\\\">\\n        <div><label>App name</label><input id=\\\"name\\\" value=\\\"Imported HTML App\\\"></div>\\n        <div><label>Start/menu name</label><input id=\\\"entry\\\" value=\\\"Imported HTML App\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"two\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <div><label>Category 1</label><input id=\\\"cat1\\\" value=\\\"Apps\\\"></div>\\n        <div><label>Category 2</label><input id=\\\"cat2\\\" value=\\\"Imported\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"three\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <div><label>Type</label><select id=\\\"type\\\"><option value=\\\"app\\\">app</option><option value=\\\"widget\\\">widget</option></select></div>\\n        <div><label>Width</label><input id=\\\"w\\\" type=\\\"number\\\" min=\\\"180\\\" max=\\\"2400\\\" value=\\\"1100\\\"></div>\\n        <div><label>Height</label><input id=\\\"h\\\" type=\\\"number\\\" min=\\\"120\\\" max=\\\"1800\\\" value=\\\"760\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"two\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n        <div><label>Version</label><input id=\\\"ver\\\" type=\\\"number\\\" min=\\\"1\\\" max=\\\"999\\\" value=\\\"1\\\"></div>\\n        <div><label>Desktop icon</label><select id=\\\"desktop\\\"><option value=\\\"true\\\">yes</option><option value=\\\"false\\\">no</option></select></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <label style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Icon SVG or emoji</label>\\n      <textarea id=\\\"icon\\\" style=\\\"min-height:84px\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><rect x=\\\"7\\\" y=\\\"9\\\" width=\\\"50\\\" height=\\\"46\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#052e16\\\" stroke=\\\"#86efac\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\"/><path d=\\\"M18 24h28M18 34h22M18 44h16\\\" stroke=\\\"#bbf7d0\\\" stroke-width=\\\"5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/><path d=\\\"M45 13l7 7-7 7\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#22c55e\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/></svg></textarea>\\n      <label style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Notes</label>\\n      <textarea id=\\\"notes\\\" style=\\\"min-height:76px\\\">Generated by HTML to VAiOS App Builder. Source HTML is stored in files/index.html, not duplicated inside item.html.</textarea>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"checkrow\\\"><input id=\\\"injectFs\\\" type=\\\"checkbox\\\"><label for=\\\"injectFs\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:12px\\\">Inject tiny in-app fullscreen button into HTML</label></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"checkrow\\\"><input id=\\\"addReadme\\\" type=\\\"checkbox\\\" checked><label for=\\\"addReadme\\\" style=\\\"margin:0;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:12px\\\">Include readme/spec note inside package</label></div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"row wraprow actions\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <button id=\\\"download\\\" class=\\\"good\\\">Download .vaios</button>\\n        <button id=\\\"copy\\\" class=\\\"ghost\\\">Copy package JSON</button>\\n        <button id=\\\"downloadHtml\\\" class=\\\"ghost\\\">Download current HTML</button>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"status\\\" id=\\\"status\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Ready. Load an HTML file.</div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"card previewShell\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"previewBar\\\">\\n        <strong>Preview</strong>\\n        <button id=\\\"reload\\\" class=\\\"ghost\\\">Reload preview</button>\\n        <button id=\\\"fs\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Fullscreen preview</button>\\n        <button id=\\\"clear\\\" class=\\\"bad\\\">Clear</button>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"framebox\\\"><iframe id=\\\"preview\\\" title=\\\"HTML preview\\\" sandbox=\\\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-modals allow-popups allow-downloads allow-same-origin allow-pointer-lock\\\" allow=\\\"fullscreen; pointer-lock; gamepad; autoplay; clipboard-read; clipboard-write\\\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n<script>\\n(function(){\\n  'use strict';\\n  var importedHtml='';\\n  var importedFileName='';\\n  var lastPackage='';\\n  var $=function(id){return document.getElementById(id)};\\n  var els={file:$('file'),pick:$('pick'),drop:$('drop'),fileLine:$('fileLine'),filePill:$('filePill'),name:$('name'),entry:$('entry'),cat1:$('cat1'),cat2:$('cat2'),type:$('type'),w:$('w'),h:$('h'),ver:$('ver'),desktop:$('desktop'),icon:$('icon'),notes:$('notes'),injectFs:$('injectFs'),addReadme:$('addReadme'),download:$('download'),copy:$('copy'),downloadHtml:$('downloadHtml'),status:$('status'),preview:$('preview'),reload:$('reload'),fs:$('fs'),clear:$('clear')};\\n  function nowIso(){return new Date().toISOString()}\\n  function slug(s){return String(s||'app').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,'-').replace(/^-+|-+$/g,'').slice(0,52)||'app'}\\n  function clean(s,fallback){s=String(s||'').replace(/\\\\s+/g,' ').trim();return (s||fallback||'Untitled').slice(0,90)}\\n  function byteLen(s){try{return new Blob([String(s||'')]).size}catch(e){return String(s||'').length}}\\n  function humanBytes(n){n=Number(n)||0;var u=['B','KB','MB','GB'];var i=0;while(n>=1024&&i<u.length-1){n/=1024;i++}return (i?n.toFixed(n>=10?1:2):Math.round(n))+ ' '+u[i]}\\n  function uid(p){return (p||'app')+'_'+Date.now().toString(36)+'_'+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,8)}\\n  function setStatus(s){els.status.textContent=s}\\n  function safeNameFromFile(name){name=String(name||'Imported HTML App').replace(/\\\\.[^.]+$/,'').replace(/[_-]+/g,' ').replace(/\\\\s+/g,' ').trim();return clean(name,'Imported HTML App')}\\n  function downloadBlob(content,name,type){var blob=new Blob([content],{type:type||'application/octet-stream'});var a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download=name;document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();setTimeout(function(){URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href);a.remove()},1000)}\\n  function injectFullscreenButton(html){\\n    var style='\\\\n<style id=\\\"vaios-inline-fullscreen-style\\\">#vaiosInlineFullscreen{position:fixed;right:12px;top:12px;z-index:2147483647;background:rgba(3,16,8,.88);color:#eaffef;border:2px solid #86efac;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;font:900 13px system-ui,Tahoma,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.45);cursor:pointer}</style>\\\\n';\\n    var scriptOpen='<scr'+'ipt id=\\\"vaios-inline-fullscreen-script\\\">';\\n    var scriptClose='</scr'+'ipt>';\\n    var script='(function(){if(document.getElementById(\\\"vaiosInlineFullscreen\\\"))return;var b=document.createElement(\\\"button\\\");b.id=\\\"vaiosInlineFullscreen\\\";b.type=\\\"button\\\";b.textContent=\\\"\\u26f6 Fullscreen\\\";b.addEventListener(\\\"click\\\",function(){var el=document.documentElement;if(el.requestFullscreen)el.requestFullscreen();else if(el.webkitRequestFullscreen)el.webkitRequestFullscreen();});document.addEventListener(\\\"keydown\\\",function(e){if(e.key===\\\"F11\\\"||((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()===\\\"f\\\")){try{b.click()}catch(_){}}});document.body.appendChild(b);})();';\\n    var code=style+scriptOpen+script+scriptClose+'\\\\n';\\n    html=String(html||'');\\n    if(/<\\\\/body>/i.test(html))return html.replace(/<\\\\/body>/i,code+'</body>');\\n    return html+code;\\n  }\\n\\n  function currentHtml(){var h=importedHtml||'<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><title>Imported HTML App</title></head><body><h1>Imported HTML App</h1><p>No source loaded yet.</p></body></html>';return els.injectFs.checked?injectFullscreenButton(h):h}\\n  function updatePreview(){var h=currentHtml();els.preview.setAttribute('allow','fullscreen; pointer-lock; gamepad; autoplay; clipboard-read; clipboard-write');els.preview.allowFullscreen=true;els.preview.srcdoc=h;setStatus(statusText('Preview refreshed.'))}\\n  function statusText(prefix){var h=currentHtml();var big=byteLen(h)>1024*1024?\\\"\\\\nLarge app rule: OK. HTML will be stored only in files/index.html, not duplicated into item.html.\\\":\\\"\\\";return (prefix?prefix+'\\\\n':'')+'File: '+(importedFileName||'none')+'\\\\nHTML size: '+humanBytes(byteLen(h))+'\\\\nOutput name: '+clean(els.name.value,'Imported HTML App')+'.vaios'+big}\\n  function buildPackage(){\\n    var h=currentHtml();\\n    if(!h.trim())throw new Error('No HTML loaded.');\\n    var type=els.type.value==='widget'?'widget':'app';\\n    var name=clean(els.name.value,'Imported HTML App');\\n    var entry=clean(els.entry.value,name);\\n    var id=slug(name)+'_'+Date.now().toString(36);\\n    var folder=(type==='widget'?'/Widgets/':'/Apps/')+slug(name);\\n    var created=nowIso();\\n    var item={\\n      id:id,type:type,name:name,category1:clean(els.cat1.value,type==='widget'?'Widgets':'Apps'),category2:clean(els.cat2.value,'Imported'),entryName:entry,\\n      icon:String(els.icon.value||'\\ud83d\\udcc4'),desktopIcon:els.desktop.value==='true',preferredWidth:Math.max(180,Math.min(2400,Number(els.w.value)||1100)),preferredHeight:Math.max(120,Math.min(1800,Number(els.h.value)||760)),\\n      html:'',notes:String(els.notes.value||''),parentId:'',editPrompt:'',version:Math.max(1,Math.min(999,Number(els.ver.value)||1)),baseName:name,createdAt:created,updatedAt:created,htmlSize:byteLen(h),externalHtmlKey:''\\n    };\\n    var manifest=Object.assign({},item,{html:undefined,folder:folder,sourcePath:folder+'/index.html',manifestPath:folder+'/manifest.json',itemJsonPath:folder+'/item.json'});\\n    var itemJson=Object.assign({},item,{folder:folder,sourcePath:folder+'/index.html',manifestPath:folder+'/manifest.json',itemJsonPath:folder+'/item.json'});\\n    var files={\\n      'index.html':h,\\n      'manifest.json':JSON.stringify(manifest,null,2),\\n      'item.json':JSON.stringify(itemJson,null,2)\\n    };\\n    if(els.addReadme.checked){files['readme.txt']='This VAiOS package was created by HTML to VAiOS App Builder. The real app source is files/index.html. The item.html field is intentionally blank so large self-contained HTML files do not duplicate data and trigger storage quota errors. Import with a VAiOS desktop that supports files/index.html and IndexedDB large-source storage. Generated: '+created+'\\\\n';}\\n    return {kind:'vaios-app-package',extension:'vaios',version:1,createdAt:created,desktop:'Virtual Desktop Builder',item:item,folder:folder,files:files};\\n  }\\n  var __vdSeq=0,__vdPending={};\\n  window.addEventListener('message',function(ev){var m=ev.data||{};if(!m.__vdesktop_reply||!m.requestId||!__vdPending[m.requestId])return;var p=__vdPending[m.requestId];delete __vdPending[m.requestId];if(m.ok)p.resolve(m.result);else p.reject(new Error(m.error||'Desktop bridge request failed.'));});\\n  function callDesktop(action,payload,timeout){return new Promise(function(resolve,reject){if(!(window.parent&&window.parent!==window&&typeof window.parent.postMessage==='function')){reject(new Error('Not running inside the VAiOS desktop iframe.'));return}var rid='htmlvaios_'+(++__vdSeq)+'_'+Date.now();var timer=setTimeout(function(){if(__vdPending[rid]){delete __vdPending[rid];reject(new Error('Desktop bridge timed out: '+action));}},timeout||300000);__vdPending[rid]={resolve:function(v){clearTimeout(timer);resolve(v)},reject:function(e){clearTimeout(timer);reject(e)}};var msg=Object.assign({__vdesktop:true,action:action,requestId:rid},payload||{});window.parent.postMessage(msg,'*');});}\\n  function desktopAIReady(){return !!((window.VDesktop&&typeof window.VDesktop.askAI==='function')||(window.parent&&window.parent!==window&&typeof window.parent.postMessage==='function'))}\\n  function desktopInstallReady(){return !!((window.VDesktop&&typeof window.VDesktop.installVaiosText==='function')||(window.parent&&window.parent!==window&&typeof window.parent.postMessage==='function'))}\\n  function desktopAskAI(systemPrompt,userPrompt,kind){if(window.VDesktop&&typeof window.VDesktop.askAI==='function')return window.VDesktop.askAI(systemPrompt,userPrompt,kind);return callDesktop('askAI',{systemPrompt:String(systemPrompt||''),userPrompt:String(userPrompt||''),kind:kind||'html'},300000)}\\n  function desktopInstallVaiosText(raw,opts){opts=opts||{};if(window.VDesktop&&typeof window.VDesktop.installVaiosText==='function')return window.VDesktop.installVaiosText(raw,opts);return callDesktop('installVaiosText',{raw:String(raw||''),ask:opts.ask!==false,openAfter:!!opts.openAfter},120000)}\\n  function stripFence(s){return String(s||'').replace(/^```[a-zA-Z0-9_-]*\\\\s*/,'').replace(/```$/,'').trim()}\\n  function looksSvg(s){s=String(s||'').trim();return /^<svg[\\\\s>]/i.test(s)&&/<\\\\/svg>\\\\s*$/i.test(s)&&!/script/i.test(s)}\\n  function parseJsonLoose(s){s=stripFence(s);try{return JSON.parse(s)}catch(e){}var m=s.match(/\\\\{[\\\\s\\\\S]*\\\\}/);if(m){try{return JSON.parse(m[0])}catch(e){}}return null}\\n  function escXml(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\\\\\\\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\\\"':'&quot;'}[c]||c})}\\n  function fallbackSvg(name,type){var label=clean(name||'HTML','HTML').slice(0,3).toUpperCase().replace(/[^A-Z0-9]/g,'')||'HTML';var badge=(type==='widget'?'W':'A');return '<svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><rect x=\\\"7\\\" y=\\\"5\\\" width=\\\"50\\\" height=\\\"54\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#031008\\\" stroke=\\\"#86efac\\\" stroke-width=\\\"3\\\"/><path d=\\\"M18 18h28M18 29h22M18 40h28\\\" stroke=\\\"#bbf7d0\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/><rect x=\\\"39\\\" y=\\\"39\\\" width=\\\"14\\\" height=\\\"14\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#166534\\\" stroke=\\\"#22c55e\\\"/><text x=\\\"46\\\" y=\\\"50\\\" font-family=\\\"Arial,sans-serif\\\" font-size=\\\"10\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#eafff0\\\">'+badge+'</text><text x=\\\"32\\\" y=\\\"15\\\" font-family=\\\"Arial,sans-serif\\\" font-size=\\\"8\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\" fill=\\\"#eafff0\\\">'+escXml(label)+'</text></svg>'}\\n  function updatePackageRecords(pkg,item){var folder=(item.type==='widget'?'/Widgets/':'/Apps/')+slug(item.name);pkg.folder=folder;pkg.item=item;var manifest=Object.assign({},item,{html:undefined,folder:folder,sourcePath:folder+'/index.html',manifestPath:folder+'/manifest.json',itemJsonPath:folder+'/item.json'});var itemJson=Object.assign({},item,{folder:folder,sourcePath:folder+'/index.html',manifestPath:folder+'/manifest.json',itemJsonPath:folder+'/item.json'});pkg.files=pkg.files||{};pkg.files['manifest.json']=JSON.stringify(manifest,null,2);pkg.files['item.json']=JSON.stringify(itemJson,null,2);return pkg}\\n  async function enhancePkgWithLLM(pkg){\\n    var item=pkg.item||{};var html=String((pkg.files&&pkg.files['index.html'])||'').slice(0,9000);var notes=[];var icon=item.icon;\\n    var context='Current name: '+String(item.name||'')+'\\\\nType: '+String(item.type||'app')+'\\\\nCategory: '+String(item.category1||'')+' / '+String(item.category2||'')+'\\\\nFile name: '+String(importedFileName||'')+'\\\\nHTML start:\\\\n'+html.slice(0,4500);\\n    if(!desktopAIReady()){notes.push('Desktop LLM bridge unavailable. Used generated fallback SVG/metadata.');icon=fallbackSvg(item.name,item.type)}else{\\n      try{setStatus('LLM pass 1/2: generating SVG icon...');var svg=await desktopAskAI('Return ONLY one inline SVG element. No markdown. No JSON. Use <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">. No scripts. No external images. Make it clear as a small VAiOS desktop icon.','Create an SVG icon for this VAiOS '+String(item.type||'app')+' made from imported HTML. The icon should represent what the HTML appears to do, not the builder tool.\\\\n\\\\n'+context,'svg');svg=stripFence(svg).replace(/^.*?(<svg[\\\\s\\\\S]*<\\\\/svg>).*$/i,'$1').trim();if(looksSvg(svg))icon=svg;else throw new Error('LLM did not return a valid SVG.')}catch(e){notes.push('SVG LLM skipped: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)));icon=fallbackSvg(item.name,item.type)}}\\n    var meta=null;\\n    if(desktopAIReady()){\\n      try{setStatus('LLM pass 2/2: generating metadata...');var raw=await desktopAskAI('Return ONLY strict JSON. Shape: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"app or widget\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"short display name\\\",\\\"category1\\\":\\\"generic top-level category\\\",\\\"category2\\\":\\\"generic second-level category\\\",\\\"entryName\\\":\\\"menu item name\\\",\\\"desktopIcon\\\":true,\\\"preferredWidth\\\":1100,\\\"preferredHeight\\\":760}. No markdown.','Create clean VAiOS metadata for this imported HTML. Keep names short, categories generic, and infer app vs widget only from the HTML purpose.\\\\n\\\\n'+context,'json');meta=parseJsonLoose(raw);if(!meta||typeof meta!=='object')throw new Error('LLM metadata was not JSON.')}catch(e){notes.push('Metadata LLM skipped: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)))}}\\n    if(meta){\\n      var chosenType=(meta.type==='widget'||meta.type==='app')?meta.type:item.type;item.type=chosenType;\\n      item.name=clean(meta.name,item.name);item.entryName=clean(meta.entryName||meta.name,item.entryName||item.name);item.category1=clean(meta.category1,item.category1||'Apps');item.category2=clean(meta.category2,item.category2||'Imported');item.desktopIcon=meta.desktopIcon!==false;\\n      item.preferredWidth=Math.max(180,Math.min(2400,Number(meta.preferredWidth)||item.preferredWidth||1100));item.preferredHeight=Math.max(120,Math.min(1800,Number(meta.preferredHeight)||item.preferredHeight||760));\\n      item.baseName=item.name;\\n    }\\n    item.icon=icon;item.updatedAt=nowIso();item.notes=String(item.notes||'')+'\\\\nSVG/metadata pass ran during .vaios download.'+(notes.length?'\\\\n'+notes.join('\\\\n'):'');\\n    if(notes.length)setStatus('LLM had an issue, but package is still valid.\\\\n'+notes.join('\\\\n'));else setStatus('LLM SVG/metadata complete. Packaging .vaios...');\\n    return updatePackageRecords(pkg,item);\\n  }\\n  async function makeAndDownload(){try{var pkg=buildPackage();setStatus('Preparing VAiOS package: LLM SVG/metadata pass...');pkg=await enhancePkgWithLLM(pkg);lastPackage=JSON.stringify(pkg,null,2);downloadBlob(lastPackage,slug(pkg.item.name)+'-v'+pkg.item.version+'.vaios','application/vnd.vaios+json');setStatus(statusText('Downloaded VAiOS package. Name: '+pkg.item.name));if(desktopInstallReady()){try{setStatus('Download complete. Asking desktop if you want to install it...');var res=await desktopInstallVaiosText(lastPackage,{ask:true,openAfter:false});if(res&&res.installed)setStatus('Downloaded and installed: '+res.name);else setStatus('Downloaded. Install skipped.');}catch(e){setStatus('Downloaded, but install request failed: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)))}}}catch(e){setStatus('Build failed: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)))}}\\n  async function copyPackage(){try{var pkg=buildPackage();setStatus('Preparing copy: LLM SVG/metadata pass...');pkg=await enhancePkgWithLLM(pkg);lastPackage=JSON.stringify(pkg,null,2);if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(lastPackage).then(function(){setStatus('Package JSON copied to clipboard.');},function(){setStatus('Clipboard blocked. Use Download .vaios instead.');});}else{setStatus('Clipboard API unavailable. Use Download .vaios.')}}catch(e){setStatus('Copy failed: '+(e&&e.message?e.message:String(e)))}}\\n  function loadFile(f){if(!f)return;var r=new FileReader();r.onload=function(){importedHtml=String(r.result||'');importedFileName=f.name||'imported.html';var nm=safeNameFromFile(importedFileName);els.name.value=nm;els.entry.value=nm;els.fileLine.textContent=importedFileName+' \\u00b7 '+humanBytes(byteLen(importedHtml));els.filePill.textContent=humanBytes(byteLen(importedHtml));setStatus(statusText('Loaded HTML.'));updatePreview();};r.onerror=function(){setStatus('Could not read file.');};r.readAsText(f)}\\n  els.pick.onclick=function(){els.file.click()};\\n  els.file.onchange=function(e){loadFile(e.target.files&&e.target.files[0])};\\n  ['dragenter','dragover'].forEach(function(ev){els.drop.addEventListener(ev,function(e){e.preventDefault();els.drop.classList.add('drag')})});\\n  ['dragleave','drop'].forEach(function(ev){els.drop.addEventListener(ev,function(e){e.preventDefault();els.drop.classList.remove('drag')})});\\n  els.drop.addEventListener('drop',function(e){var f=e.dataTransfer&&e.dataTransfer.files&&e.dataTransfer.files[0];loadFile(f)});\\n  els.reload.onclick=updatePreview;\\n  els.fs.onclick=function(){var target=els.preview;if(target.requestFullscreen)target.requestFullscreen();else if(target.webkitRequestFullscreen)target.webkitRequestFullscreen();};\\n  els.clear.onclick=function(){importedHtml='';importedFileName='';els.preview.srcdoc='';els.fileLine.textContent='or drag/drop one here';els.filePill.textContent='No HTML loaded';setStatus('Cleared.');};\\n  els.download.onclick=makeAndDownload;\\n  els.copy.onclick=copyPackage;\\n  els.downloadHtml.onclick=function(){downloadBlob(currentHtml(),slug(clean(els.name.value,'imported-app'))+'.html','text/html')};\\n  [els.name,els.entry,els.cat1,els.cat2,els.type,els.w,els.h,els.ver,els.desktop,els.icon,els.notes,els.injectFs,els.addReadme].forEach(function(el){el.addEventListener('input',function(){setStatus(statusText('Settings updated.'))});el.addEventListener('change',function(){setStatus(statusText('Settings updated.'))})});\\n  setStatus(statusText('Ready. Load an HTML file. Download .vaios runs SVG/metadata LLM pass first, with fallback if local fetch fails.'));\\n})();\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\",\n  \"notes\": \"Universal builder that converts any self-contained HTML file into a valid VAiOS app package. Source is stored in files/index.html only to avoid quota duplication.\",\n  \"parentId\": \"\",\n  \"editPrompt\": \"\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"baseName\": \"HTML to VAiOS Builder\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:23:04Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:28:32Z\",\n  \"htmlSize\": 25187\n}",
    "readme.txt": "Universal HTML to VAiOS converter. Import this .vaios into VAiOS, open it, choose any HTML file, then download a finished .vaios app. Large source HTML is written to files/index.html and not duplicated into item.html.\n\nPATCH: fixed nested script-tag parsing by splitting generated <script> tags as <scr+ipt>. This prevents JavaScript source dumping into the UI when imported into VAiOS iframes.\n",
    "VAiOS_APP_SPEC.md": "# VAiOS App Package Format and Builder Guide\n\nThis document is the working contract for creating valid `.vaios` apps for the Virtual Desktop Builder / VAiOS desktop.\n\nA `.vaios` file is a JSON package. It is not a zip. It should be saved with the `.vaios` extension and imported through the desktop App Manager or Backup / Restore window.\n\n## Core rule\n\nA valid app package must be self-contained:\n\n- The package must include metadata in `item`.\n- The actual app HTML must be available as `files[\"index.html\"]`.\n- Large HTML must not be duplicated in `item.html`.\n- The imported app must be able to run inside a sandboxed iframe.\n\nThe safe modern pattern is:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"kind\": \"vaios-app-package\",\n  \"extension\": \"vaios\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"desktop\": \"Virtual Desktop Builder\",\n  \"item\": {\n    \"id\": \"my_app_001\",\n    \"type\": \"app\",\n    \"name\": \"My App\",\n    \"category1\": \"Apps\",\n    \"category2\": \"Imported\",\n    \"entryName\": \"My App\",\n    \"icon\": \"📄\",\n    \"desktopIcon\": true,\n    \"preferredWidth\": 1100,\n    \"preferredHeight\": 760,\n    \"html\": \"\",\n    \"notes\": \"Source is stored in files/index.html.\",\n    \"parentId\": \"\",\n    \"editPrompt\": \"\",\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"baseName\": \"My App\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:00:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"folder\": \"/Apps/my-app\",\n  \"files\": {\n    \"index.html\": \"<!doctype html><html>...</html>\",\n    \"manifest.json\": \"{...metadata without duplicated html...}\",\n    \"item.json\": \"{...metadata without duplicated html...}\",\n    \"readme.txt\": \"Optional notes.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Required top-level fields\n\n| Field | Required | Purpose |\n|---|---:|---|\n| `kind` | yes | Must be exactly `vaios-app-package`. |\n| `extension` | recommended | Use `vaios`. |\n| `version` | yes | Package format version. Use `1`. |\n| `createdAt` | recommended | ISO timestamp. |\n| `desktop` | recommended | Human label, usually `Virtual Desktop Builder`. |\n| `item` | yes | App/widget metadata object. |\n| `folder` | recommended | Virtual folder path, such as `/Apps/my-app`. |\n| `files` | yes | File map. Must include `index.html`. |\n\n## Required `item` fields\n\n| Field | Required | Valid values / notes |\n|---|---:|---|\n| `id` | yes | Stable unique ID. Use lowercase slug plus timestamp/random suffix. |\n| `type` | yes | `app` or `widget`. |\n| `name` | yes | Display name. |\n| `entryName` | yes | Start menu / desktop icon label. |\n| `category1` | yes | Top-level menu group, e.g. `Apps`, `Games`, `Tools`, `System`. |\n| `category2` | yes | Second-level group, e.g. `Imported`, `Launchers`, `Editors`. |\n| `icon` | yes | Emoji, data URL, or inline SVG string. |\n| `desktopIcon` | yes | Boolean. |\n| `preferredWidth` | yes | Number in pixels. Apps usually 700–1400. |\n| `preferredHeight` | yes | Number in pixels. Apps usually 480–1000. |\n| `html` | yes | Use empty string for large/modern packages. Do not duplicate `files/index.html`. |\n| `notes` | recommended | Plain text notes. |\n| `parentId` | recommended | Empty for original app, original ID for imported/derived app. |\n| `editPrompt` | recommended | Empty unless this came from an AI edit. |\n| `version` | recommended | App version number. |\n| `baseName` | recommended | Name without version suffix. |\n| `createdAt` | recommended | ISO timestamp. |\n| `updatedAt` | recommended | ISO timestamp. |\n\n## The single most important quota rule\n\nNever put the same large HTML in multiple places.\n\nBad for huge apps:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"item\": { \"html\": \"<!doctype html>...massive game...\" },\n  \"files\": { \"index.html\": \"<!doctype html>...same massive game...\" }\n}\n```\n\nGood for huge apps:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"item\": { \"html\": \"\", \"htmlSize\": 12345678 },\n  \"files\": { \"index.html\": \"<!doctype html>...massive game...\" }\n}\n```\n\nA fresh modern VAiOS desktop imports `files/index.html`. If the HTML is large, the desktop stores it in IndexedDB and keeps only metadata in localStorage. This is how large self-contained games avoid quota errors.\n\n## `files` map\n\nThe `files` object is a relative-path-to-content map. All values are strings.\n\nRecommended files:\n\n- `index.html`: required. The app source.\n- `manifest.json`: recommended metadata snapshot.\n- `item.json`: recommended metadata snapshot.\n- `readme.txt`: optional human notes.\n- Extra assets are allowed, but VAiOS currently runs the app from `index.html` as iframe `srcdoc`, so external relative assets may not resolve unless they are embedded into the HTML or the desktop implements asset URL rewriting.\n\nFor maximum portability, make `index.html` self-contained: inline CSS, inline JavaScript, data URLs for images/audio, or remote URLs where acceptable.\n\n## HTML requirements\n\nA VAiOS app runs inside an iframe. The HTML should therefore obey these rules:\n\n1. Use a complete document: `<!doctype html><html><head>...</head><body>...</body></html>`.\n2. Include `<meta charset=\"utf-8\">`.\n3. Include a mobile viewport meta tag.\n4. Keep layout inside the iframe width. Avoid horizontal scrolling unless the app intentionally needs it.\n5. Do not assume top-level window control. The parent desktop owns the window frame.\n6. For fullscreen, prefer the VAiOS app menu fullscreen option. An app may also provide its own fullscreen button.\n7. For pointer-lock games, the parent iframe must include `allow-pointer-lock`, and the iframe `allow` attribute must include `pointer-lock`.\n8. Remote websites may refuse iframe embedding with `X-Frame-Options` or CSP `frame-ancestors`. A VAiOS package cannot override remote server headers. Use local/offline HTML for blocked sites.\n\n## Iframe permissions expected by the desktop\n\nGame-capable app iframes should use permissions similar to:\n\n```html\n<iframe\n  sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-modals allow-popups allow-downloads allow-same-origin allow-pointer-lock\"\n  allow=\"fullscreen; pointer-lock; gamepad; autoplay; clipboard-read; clipboard-write\"\n  allowfullscreen>\n</iframe>\n```\n\nThe app package itself does not set the parent iframe attributes. The desktop builder does that when opening the app. This is why the desktop must be patched for pointer lock and fullscreen support.\n\n## Icon rules\n\n`item.icon` may be:\n\n- An emoji, for example `📄`.\n- An inline SVG string.\n- A `data:image/...` URL.\n\nBest SVG shape:\n\n```xml\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">...</svg>\n```\n\nDo not include scripts in SVG icons. Keep icons readable at small desktop size.\n\n## Naming and folder rules\n\nFor an app named `My Game`, use:\n\n- `item.name`: `My Game`\n- `item.entryName`: `My Game`\n- `item.baseName`: `My Game`\n- `folder`: `/Apps/my-game`\n- `id`: `my-game_<timestamp-or-random>`\n\nFor a widget, use `/Widgets/my-widget`.\n\nFolder names should be slugs: lowercase letters, numbers, and hyphens.\n\n## App versus widget\n\nUse `type: \"app\"` for:\n\n- Games\n- Dashboards\n- Editors\n- Tools\n- Anything large or interactive\n\nUse `type: \"widget\"` for:\n\n- Clocks\n- Small meters\n- Sticky notes\n- Compact trackers\n- Read-only glance panels\n\nWidgets should have smaller preferred sizes, usually 220–420 wide and 140–320 high.\n\n## Valid minimal package\n\n```json\n{\n  \"kind\": \"vaios-app-package\",\n  \"extension\": \"vaios\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"desktop\": \"Virtual Desktop Builder\",\n  \"item\": {\n    \"id\": \"hello_vaios_001\",\n    \"type\": \"app\",\n    \"name\": \"Hello VAiOS\",\n    \"category1\": \"Apps\",\n    \"category2\": \"Demo\",\n    \"entryName\": \"Hello VAiOS\",\n    \"icon\": \"📄\",\n    \"desktopIcon\": true,\n    \"preferredWidth\": 800,\n    \"preferredHeight\": 540,\n    \"html\": \"\",\n    \"notes\": \"Demo app. Source in files/index.html.\",\n    \"parentId\": \"\",\n    \"editPrompt\": \"\",\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"baseName\": \"Hello VAiOS\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:00:00.000Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-06-23T00:00:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"folder\": \"/Apps/hello-vaios\",\n  \"files\": {\n    \"index.html\": \"<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\"><meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\"><title>Hello VAiOS</title></head><body><h1>Hello VAiOS</h1></body></html>\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## AI generation workflow\n\nFor first-pass new apps:\n\n1. Return only full HTML.\n2. No tools.\n3. No JSON.\n4. No SVG-only icon.\n5. No metadata.\n6. Full document only: `<!doctype html>`, `<html>`, `<head>`, `<body>`.\n\nThen run separate passes:\n\n1. Icon pass: return only inline SVG.\n2. Metadata pass: return only JSON metadata.\n3. Package pass: combine metadata, icon, and `files/index.html` into the `.vaios` package.\n\nFor v2/edit mode:\n\n- Use tool editing only against existing `index.html`.\n- Do not return the whole HTML as the final answer.\n- Preserve working import/export/storage behavior.\n\n## Validation checklist\n\nBefore shipping a `.vaios`, check:\n\n- JSON parses without error.\n- Top-level `kind` is exactly `vaios-app-package`.\n- `version` is `1`.\n- `item.type` is `app` or `widget`.\n- `item.name`, `item.entryName`, `category1`, and `category2` are non-empty.\n- `item.preferredWidth` and `item.preferredHeight` are numbers.\n- `files.index.html` exists and is non-empty.\n- Large HTML is not duplicated in `item.html`.\n- Icon is an emoji, inline SVG, or data URL.\n- The app runs inside an iframe using `srcdoc`.\n- Games that need mouse capture are tested on a desktop with `allow-pointer-lock`.\n- Export downloads directly and does not require saving into internal `/Backups` first.\n\n## Common failures\n\n### Quota exceeded\n\nCause: huge HTML duplicated in localStorage, virtual filesystem, backup JSONL, and `.vaios` package.\n\nFix:\n\n- Store source only in `files/index.html` inside the `.vaios`.\n- Keep `item.html` empty.\n- Use a VAiOS desktop that imports large HTML into IndexedDB.\n- Do not save giant packages into internal `/Backups` before download.\n\n### Script text dumped on the page\n\nCause: a generated wrapper contains a literal `</script>` inside a JavaScript string/template, closing the outer script early.\n\nFix:\n\n- Avoid wrapper apps when possible.\n- If generating script text inside script text, split tags as `'<scr'+'ipt>'` and `'</scr'+'ipt>'`.\n- Best solution: put the final app directly in `files/index.html` with no wrapper.\n\n### Remote site will not load in iframe\n\nCause: server headers like `X-Frame-Options` or CSP `frame-ancestors`.\n\nFix:\n\n- Use an offline/local HTML client.\n- Open external in a new tab.\n- Use a reverse proxy you control if legal and appropriate.\n- Do not expect app HTML to override remote browser security headers.\n\n### Pointer lock does not work\n\nCause: parent iframe missing permission.\n\nFix desktop iframe attributes:\n\n```html\nsandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-modals allow-popups allow-downloads allow-same-origin allow-pointer-lock\"\nallow=\"fullscreen; pointer-lock; gamepad; autoplay; clipboard-read; clipboard-write\"\nallowfullscreen\n```\n\n## Recommended builder behavior\n\nA universal HTML-to-VAiOS builder should:\n\n1. Let the user pick any `.html` or `.htm` file.\n2. Keep the selected HTML in memory only.\n3. Preview it in an iframe.\n4. Let the user set name, categories, icon, type, size, and desktop icon flag.\n5. Generate a package with the real HTML in `files/index.html`.\n6. Keep `item.html` blank.\n7. Download the `.vaios` directly.\n8. Never require writing the huge package into localStorage first.\n9. Optionally include a `readme.txt` file.\n10. Warn if the imported HTML uses external relative assets.\n\n## Final contract\n\nA `.vaios` app is valid when this is true:\n\n> A fresh patched VAiOS desktop can import the `.vaios`, create a desktop/start-menu entry from `item`, store large HTML outside localStorage when necessary, and open `files/index.html` inside the app iframe without needing any additional files unless those files are embedded or reachable.\n"
  }
}
